# Class instance dispatch: multi-instance function resolution
# This test verifies that the type checker's call_dispatch annotation is correctly
# propagated through lower() to the evaluator. The lowerer (lower.rs:756-766) checks
# call_dispatch.get() on VarRef nodes. If this test fails, the wiring between type
# checker and lowerer for multi-instance dispatch is broken.
[
  Greeter: [class [let Greeter a]]

  [instance Greeter [let a@String]: [greet: [fn [let x] [str "Hello, " x "!"]]]]
  [instance Greeter [let a@Integer]: [greet: [fn [let x] [str "Number " [str x]]]]]

  r1: [greet "Alice"]
  r2: [greet 42]
]
=== out
["r1": "Hello, Alice!"  "r2": "Number 42"]
